   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Hello,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">I am planning to estimate density using SMR of a species that travels in groups. I believe this grouping behaviour violates the model assumptions. Does anyone have any recommendations of resources on how to deal with this? Is it possible to account for during the analysis stage?</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Thank you,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;\">Devin </p>"
    ]
   ]
  },
